@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title SS-12  Request personalized suggestions
' Requirements: PROFILE-01 PROFILE-02 REC-01 REC-02 REC-03 REC-04 AI-02 AI-04 AI-05 AI-06 ROAD-09
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Student" as U
participant "CS-GAMUERS" as S
U -> S: Request course and career-path recommendations
note over U,S
Apply shared saved-outcome rules (diagram index / FC-07).
Resolve accessible success before new-generation checks:
no generation or extra usage, even at 20 used or during outage.
Permissions, privacy, deletion/expiry and current catalog apply.
end note
alt Accessible saved success for the same logical request
  S --> U: Return saved outcome; usage unchanged; show allowance/reset time
  note over U,S
  No course starts or roadmap activation on replay.
  Preview and explicit acceptance still required for proposals.
  end note
else Required learning profile is incomplete
  S --> U: Identify required profile answers; keep course browsing available
else Profile is complete
  alt Daily allowance exhausted or AI unavailable
    S --> U: Explain unavailability and offer catalog browsing/later retry
  else AI request can run
    note over S
    Match goals and interests to approved catalog.
    Adjust using experience, optional latest assessment,
    and completed courses; do not attach account identity.
    end note
    alt No suitable catalog content
      S --> U: Explain catalog gap; do not invent courses or career paths
    else Suitable content exists
      S --> U: Up to 3 career paths and 5 courses, with reasons
      note over S
      Only published content open to new learners.
      Exclude completed courses from next-course suggestions.
      Show fewer results when appropriate.
      end note
    end
    note over S
    Count a successful logical AI request once.
    Failed requests do not consume allowance.
    end note
  end
end
note over U,S
Suggestions do not start courses or replace a roadmap.
External AI roadmaps remain deferred.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | SS-12 | Product behavior
@enduml
